[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-EVENT-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Bounded independent input-edge processes
STATEMENT: >>>
The simulator shall support up to 256 independently triggered processes, each with 1..16 distinct scalar top-input rising/falling edge controls. Each triggered process shall start from pre-commit state while observing its own isolated blocking updates in later statements. Nonblocking updates from the sampled input batch shall commit together. Auxiliary four-state inputs shall retain the scalar 0/1/X/Z edge table; the primary clock shall start known zero.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Baseline implementation and evidence: RtlDesign.EventEvaluation; runtime edge_event; docs/open-items-100.md, numbered cases 001..040 and primary-negedge startup regression. This requirement excludes generated clocks, arbitrary event expressions and general timed scheduling. Final regression rechecks baseline behavior after this batch.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: src/VeloSim.Core/RtlDesign.cs
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/VeloSim.Tests/RtlOpenItems100Tests.cs

