[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-COMB-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: General combinational processes
STATEMENT: The simulator shall support always_comb processes with language-defined sensitivity and scheduling.
COMMENT: Open backlog; the existing continuous-assignment DAG is a separate bounded contract.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-PROC-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: General procedural constructs
STATEMENT: The simulator shall support initialization, runtime-controlled loops, functions and tasks.
COMMENT: Open backlog; constant repeat and supported sequential statements do not close this requirement.

