[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-FUNC-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Pure bounded automatic functions
STATEMENT: >>>
The frontend shall inline nonrecursive automatic packed-word functions with positional input formals, whole-local blocking assignments, block and if statements, and function-name return assignment on every path. Every argument, local assignment and result shall retain its declared width, signedness and two-state conversion. Captured mutable globals, global writes, timing, selected local writes and persistent-state reads shall be rejected. Extensions for constant captures and explicit returns are specified by VS-RTL-PARAM-001 and VS-RTL-FLOW-001. Calls shall have bounded depth, argument/local counts and symbolic expansion.
<<<
COMMENT: Qualified by batch combinational-subroutines-200, 831 executed full-regression passes and coverage gate 20261025-042139-8795316: cases 041..080 and 161..180, same original source through Surelog/UHDM and Icarus, standalone and SDK. General functions remain part of VS-RTL-PROC-001.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: native/uhdm/rtl_subroutines.h
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: src/VeloSim.Core/RtlConversion.cs
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/VeloSim.Tests/RtlCombinational200Tests.cs

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-TASK-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Pure zero-time automatic tasks
STATEMENT: >>>
The frontend shall inline automatic zero-time tasks with positional input and whole-word output arguments, pure local blocking computation and definite assignment of every output. Output copy-out shall sample all results before changing destination words. Inout/ref, aliased output parents, selected output actuals, timing, captured globals and nested task calls shall be rejected. Combined outputs shall be bounded to 128 bits.
<<<
COMMENT: Qualified by batch combinational-subroutines-200, 831 executed full-regression passes and coverage gate 20261025-042139-8795316: cases 081..120 and negative cases 181..200. Blocking-isolation rules continue to apply to calls in sequential processes. General tasks remain part of VS-RTL-PROC-001.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: native/uhdm/rtl_subroutines.h
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tests/VeloSim.Tests/RtlCombinational200Tests.cs

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-CLOCKLESS-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Combinational-only structural models
STATEMENT: >>>
The frontend and both generated interfaces shall support acyclic, fully assigned combinational-only modules without inventing a clock port. The IR shall represent the absent clock explicitly as null and require a canonical empty sequential body. Initial eval and subsequent input changes shall settle the graph; every actual input, including one named clk, shall retain its declared width and four-state value.
<<<
COMMENT: Qualified by functions-100, 959 executed full-regression passes and coverage gate 20261025-063443-6553218: RtlFunctions100Tests cases001..020, ConstantOnlyFirstEval and native clocklessInterfaceTests. Existing ownership, definite-assignment, feedback and resource bounds remain applicable.
