[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-FLOW-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Explicit pure-function returns and bounded loops
STATEMENT: >>>
Pure automatic functions shall support explicit return expressions with declared conversion and path termination. Supported repeat loops shall sample a known nonnegative count once, bounded to256. Supported for loops shall use a known local counter up to32bits, typed arithmetic and comparisons, a single initializer and increment, and a statically proven trip count up to256. Conditions and increments may read only the counter and immutable constants. The body, including every nested loop initializer and increment, shall not mutate the enclosing counter. Early returns shall skip later statements and enclosing loop increments. Shared node, expression, depth and expansion budgets shall reject unsupported or excessive control flow.
<<<
COMMENT: Qualified by functions-100, 959 executed full-regression passes and coverage gate 20261025-063443-6553218: RtlFunctions100Tests cases021..060 and091..100, TypedLoopControl, ExplicitReturnKeepsAssignedValue, BoundedParityReadsFormalBits and RtlNestedLoopSafetyTests. General while/do loops, break/continue and runtime-dependent trip counts remain outside this bounded contract.
