  VALUE: tests/VeloSim.Tests/RtlNestedLoopSafetyTests.cs
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: tools/FunctionMutationProbe.cs

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-PARAM-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Immutable parameter captures by elaborated declaration
STATEMENT: >>>
Pure automatic calls shall resolve known literal or unary-literal int and packed logic/bit parameter or localparam values by canonical typed declaration and visible elaborated instance identity. Exact source coordinates and original lexical scope binding may repair malformed elaborated references only when unambiguous, honoring variable/formal shadowing. Captures shall preserve declared width and signedness, local shadowing and distinct instance overrides. Caller spelling shall never substitute for declaration binding. Parameter selections and compound constant expressions shall be rejected rather than trusting lossy elaboration folding. Conflicting duplicate values, unknown or unmaterialized values, unsupported types and unresolved or ambiguous bindings shall be rejected.
<<<
COMMENT: Qualified by functions-100, 959 executed full-regression passes and coverage gate 20261025-063443-6553218: RtlFunctions100Tests cases061..080, SignedWideParameter and SubroutineLocalParameterCaptureResolvesOwnDeclaration. Mutable globals, hierarchical function calls and general constant-expression evaluation remain outside this contract.
