[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-PACKED-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Bounded packed aggregates
STATEMENT: >>>
The simulator shall lower uniformly two-state or four-state packed structures and equal-width untagged unions up to 256 bits using typed UHDM member layout. Tagged, unpacked and mixed-state aggregate forms shall fail explicitly. Union acceptance requires corrected frontend tag provenance. Each packed-type query shall bound recursive entries and member-edge traversal to 20000 work steps, including shared aliases, and reset safely after rejection.
<<<
