[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-ARRAY-SHAPE-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Fixed multidimensional arrays
STATEMENT: >>>
The simulator shall support rank one through four fixed arrays with nonnegative bounds and at most 256 elements, checking every coordinate before linearization. Address expressions shall satisfy the existing unsigned-index contract, with explicit casts for signed values. Unknown or invalid coordinates yield unknown reads and ignored writes. Dynamic arrays, associative arrays and queues require separate lifetime support.
<<<
