[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-EVENT-TRANSPORT-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Bounded native timed-event transport
STATEMENT: >>>
An internal timed-event queue shall order opaque process IDs by unsigned tick, delta, active/inactive/NBA region and insertion order. Zero-delay scheduling into an earlier region shall advance the delta. Future ticks shall start at delta zero. Time overflow, pending-capacity overflow and a lifetime execution budget shall be checked before modifying queue state. This primitive does not implement suspended HDL processes or the complete SystemVerilog scheduling algorithm.
<<<
COMMENT: Focused native verification and limitations are recorded in docs/container-events.md. General timed HDL scheduling remains open.
