[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-VERIFY-REMOTE-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Standalone Windows test campaigns and resumable results publication
STATEMENT: >>>
A standalone PowerShell workflow shall check directories and tools, reuse compatible installed dependencies, obtain a frozen Git source revision, run bounded native and managed mutation campaigns in WSL with isolated outputs, retain actual results and provenance, and prepare a small results commit on a new branch. Commit or authentication failure shall preserve results and local commits, pause for user action, and permit publication-only resume without rerunning tests. Unknown work shall not be discarded or pushed. Successful publication shall verify the remote SHA.
<<<
