[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-TRACE-COMPRESSED-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Losslessly compressed digital waveform output
STATEMENT: >>>
The simulator shall provide losslessly compressed digital waveform output in a documented format readable by an independent waveform reader. The trace shall preserve the declared widths, hierarchical signal identities, supported four-state values and simulation timestamps/time precision for the selected traced signals. Trace selection and output failures shall be reported explicitly; an uncompressed text comparison trace alone shall not satisfy this requirement.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
User explicitly requested compressed waveform output. Detailed acceptance criteria for hierarchy, values, time and failures are inferred/draft and require implementation evidence. Tracked by WP-17, https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/18. FST is the initial format candidate. GTKWave libfst is implementation information to evaluate (LIB-11), not a mandated dependency or evidence of current support: https://github.com/gtkwave/libfst. The chosen revision, component notices, exported-SDK packaging and native Windows/Linux compatibility must be recorded before adoption. No compression ratio or performance improvement is promised. Implementation and verification remain open.
<<<
