[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-VERIFY-SIMD-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Differential qualification of an experimental SVInt SIMD path
STATEMENT: >>>
An opt-in SVInt adapter shall provide a CPU/OS-gated 128-bit SIMD path and a portable scalar fallback for equal-width, equally signed bitwise operands. Both paths shall preserve four-state results, declared width and signedness, partial-word masks and bounded plane access. Qualification shall compare against unchanged pinned SVInt, independent per-bit truth tables and the current VeloSim runtime within its supported width. Performance evidence shall include complete adapter costs and shall not imply production adoption or a speedup without measured comparable results.
<<<
COMMENT: User-requested AVX128 prototype and comparison. The current adapter remains experimental; no production arithmetic replacement or Windows qualification is claimed.
