[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-SUSPEND-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Resumable timed SDK processes
STATEMENT: >>>
Supported timed UHDM statements shall lower to explicit typed IR and resumable generated process PCs. Integer procedural and intra-assignment delays, signal waits and events, blocking named-event occurrences and supported fork join families shall preserve their suspension and lifetime behavior. Blocking and NBA intra-assignment delays shall sample values and addresses before suspension/commit. Join-none children shall begin only after parent suspension or termination; wait-fork shall wait for direct children and disable-fork shall terminate descendants without removing already sampled NBA updates. Timed SDK queries shall enforce the owning-thread contract. Unsupported timed forms shall be rejected explicitly.
<<<
COMMENT: Inferred bounded acceptance for the user-requested WP-03 work. Timed calls, broader local lifetimes, general named scopes and runtime/fractional delays remain separate open acceptance items.
