The qualified frontend overlay shall preserve parsed module time-unit and precision metadata with explicit provenance on serialized UHDM instances. Timed lowering shall reject absent provenance, unsupported scales and checked conversion overflow rather than substituting unknown metadata with zero. Host-tick precision and supported integer conversion behavior shall be documented in the emitted IR/SDK contract. Overlay source revision, input hashes and compatible compiler/SDK requirements shall be retained.
