VeloSim shall support SystemVerilog constrained randomization through explicitly documented language subsets. Successful randomization shall satisfy all active supported constraints using declared width and signedness semantics. The supported rand/randc, inline constraints, enablement, ordering and distribution behavior, seed/state replay scope and failure update behavior shall be specified and verified. Unsupported constructs shall be diagnosed without silently dropping constraints. Unsatisfiable constraints, solver unknown/timeouts and infrastructure failures shall be distinguished and shall not be reported as successful randomization.
