UID: VS-RTL-RUNTIME-DELAY-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Sampled runtime integer delays
STATEMENT: >>>
Explicit-time execution shall sample typed integer delay expressions once at suspension, preserve declared signedness, and convert module time units to host ticks with checked integer arithmetic. Unknown, negative and overflowing delays shall be rejected without changing committed model state or pending events. Positive host time advances shall request evaluation through the base model interface without changing the word ABI. Zero advances shall not create a new evaluation request.
<<<
COMMENT: Inferred bounded acceptance under WP-02/WP-03. Fractional and suffixed delays remain separate. Qualification is in progress; no broad timing requirement closure.
