The explicit-time slice shall infer always @* sensitivities from read operands and destination-address expressions, preserving reads of variables also assigned. It shall wait before the first execution, rearm after the body, and never execute an empty sensitivity. Inputs deposited before process startup shall not create a remembered event. always_comb shall retain its separate startup execution behavior.
